<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kaynar rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kaynar rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber analyst David Bleustein said he initiated coverage of Kaynar Technologies Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $1.19 per share for 1997, and $1.39 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 18-1/4 Friday.</p>
</text>
